units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p f
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region target block 0 20 0 20 22.955 125.255
region whole union 2 projectile target
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 sum yes
timestep 0.001
fix 1 all nve
fix 2 all temp/berendsen 300 300 10
run 100000
unfix 2
run 500000
